plnt","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Colleen Keating","x":"While we conducted extensive testing over the past couple of years to support a potential Black Card price increase, the consumer and economic backdrop have shifted.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/planet-fitness-plnt-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PLNT 2026 Q1","e":"plnt","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Colleen Keating","x":"Based on our experience, price increases create a near-term headwind to member joins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/planet-fitness-plnt-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PLNT 2026 Q2","e":"plnt","d":"2026-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Colleen Keating","x":"As you know, we had a 10% lift in that member growth in 2025 versus 2024, despite the two headwinds of the nationwide rollout of click to cancel and the price increase of 50% on the classic card pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/planet-fitness-plnt-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PLNT 2026 Q3","e":"plnt","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sudhanshu Priyadarshi","x":"And you saw that our testing showed we can raise pricing in certain markets, and that's the reason we are making a decision that next year, we'll have a regional price increase in different markets.","url":"https://www.tradingkey.com/news/transcripts/262283677-"},{"c":"PLNT 2026 Q3","e":"plnt","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sudhanshu Priyadarshi","x":"If you -- it's important to put all the price increases we have taken.","url":"https://www.tradingkey.com/news/transcripts/262283677-"},{"c":"PLNT 2026 Q3","e":"plnt","d":"2026-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sudhanshu Priyadarshi","x":"Reflecting our third quarter results and our expectations for the fourth quarter, we are increasing our outlook for system-wide same club sales growth to approximately 1.5% to 2%, up from our prior expectation of approximately 1%.","url":"https://www.tradingkey.com/news/transcripts/262283677-"},{"c":"PLNT 2026 Q3","e":"plnt","d":"2026-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sudhanshu Priyadarshi","x":"We are lowering our outlook for new equipment placements to franchisee-owned location to 135 to 140 from 150 to 160.","url":"https://www.tradingkey.com/news/transcripts/262283677-"}],"trends":{"theater":[[64,1,5956,0,0,0,4935,627],[65,1,8457,0,0,0,7169,1027],[66,1,8328,0,0,0,2256,5758],[67,1,8431,0,0,0,2820,5133]],"cinema":[[64,1,5956,0,0,0,4935,627],[65,1,8457,0,0,0,7169,1027],[66,1,8328,0,0,0,2256,5758],[67,1,8431,0,0,0,2820,5133]],"imax":[[64,1,5956,0,0,0,4935,627],[65,1,8457,0,0,0,7169,1027],[66,1,8328,0,0,0,2256,5758],[67,1,8431,0,0,0,2820,5133]],"streaming":[[64,1,5956,0,0,0,4935,627],[65,1,8457,0,0,0,7169,1027],[66,1,8328,0,0,0,2256,5758],[67,1,8431,0,0,0,2820,5133]],"dtc":[[64,1,5956,0,0,0,4935,627],[65,1,8457,0,0,0,7169,1027],[66,1,8328,0,0,0,2256,5758],[67,1,8431,0,0,0,2820,5133]],"ai_spend":[[64,1,5956,1,1,0,4935,627],[65,1,8457,0,0,0,7169,1027],[66,1,8328,0,0,0,2256,5758],[67,1,8431,0,0,0,2820,5133]],"tariffs":[[64,1,5956,0,0,0,4935,627],[65,1,8457,0,0,0,7169,1027],[66,1,8328,0,0,0,2256,5758],[67,1,8431,0,0,0,2820,5133]],"pricing_power":[[64,1,5956,5,3,2,4935,627],[65,1,8457,6,5,1,7169,1027],[66,1,8328,1,0,1,2256,5758],[67,1,8431,8,6,2,2820,5133]],"cost_cuts":[[64,1,5956,0,0,0,4935,627],[65,1,8457,0,0,0,7169,1027],[66,1,8328,0,0,0,2256,5758],[67,1,8431,0,0,0,2820,5133]],"guidance":[[64,1,5956,0,0,0,4935,627],[65,1,8457,0,0,0,7169,1027],[66,1,8328,0,0,0,2256,5758],[67,1,8431,3,3,0,2820,5133]],"ai_disruption":[[64,1,5956,0,0,0,4935,627],[65,1,8457,0,0,0,7169,1027],[66,1,8328,0,0,0,2256,5758],[67,1,8431,0,0,0,2820,5133]]}}